## spike 2: Connectivity and processing validity
inputs:    SPECIFICATION.md
spike:     RESOLVED: Yes. Direct REST fetches 10-Q, 10-K, 8-K for ARCC, MFIC, TCPC. XBRL via `companyfacts` endpoint: 185 / 165 / 155 us-gaap concepts for ARCC / MFIC / TCPC. `NetAssetValuePerShare` confirmed 28 / 22 / 25 quarters; `InvestmentCompanySeniorSecurityIndebtednessAssetCoverageRatio` confirmed 14 / 13 quarters for ARCC / MFIC but **NOT FOUND for TCPC** (HTML fallback required); distributions per share — ARCC/TCPC use `CommonStockDividendsPerShareDeclared`, MFIC uses `InvestmentCompanyDistributionToShareholdersPerShare`. Asset coverage stored as pure decimal (1.88 = 188%) — needs ×100. Non-accrual: **NOT in XBRL for any ticker** — HTML-only. Documents: primary iXBRL HTML ~0.9 MB per 10-Q (not ~24 MB); full submission bundle ~3.8 MB. FSCO: 0 × 10-Q. See `evidence/STEP_2_CONNECTIVITY_AND_PROCESSING_VALI.md`.
evidence:  STEP_2_CONNECTIVITY_AND_PROCESSING_VALI.md
reconcile: RESOLVED: Yes. Direct REST fetches 10-Q, 10-K, 8-K for ARCC, MFIC, TCPC. XBRL via `companyfacts` endpoint: 185 / 165 / 155 us-gaap concepts for ARCC / MFIC / TCPC. `NetAssetValuePerShare` confirmed 28 / 22 / 25 quarters; `InvestmentCompanySeniorSecurityIndebtednessAssetCoverageRatio` confirmed 14 / 13 quarters for ARCC / MFIC but **NOT FOUND for TCPC** (HTML fallback required); distributions per share — ARCC/TCPC use `CommonStockDividendsPerShareDeclared`, MFIC uses `InvestmentCompanyDistributionToShareholdersPerShare`. Asset coverage stored as pure decimal (1.88 = 188%) — needs ×100. Non-accrual: **NOT in XBRL for any ticker** — HTML-only. Documents: primary iXBRL HTML ~0.9 MB per 10-Q (not ~24 MB); full submission bundle ~3.8 MB. FSCO: 0 × 10-Q. See `evidence/STEP_2_CONNECTIVITY_AND_PROCESSING_VALI.md`.
state:    awaiting_review

